<title>NORWAY: Kvaerner wins NOK 170 mln ship deal.</title>
<headline>Kvaerner wins NOK 170 mln ship deal.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction and engineering group Kvaerner ASA said on Friday its Kvaerner Kleven yard had been awarded a 170 million crown contract by Norway's District Offshore AS.</p>
<p>The contract is to build an anchor handling supply vessel for delivery in the second half of 1998.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
